{"id":"n22844-1-7","stage":4,"title":"공룡 · 恐龙","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22844-1-7-1","ko":"티라노사우루스 같은 공룡은 크기가 얼마나 커요?","zh":"像霸王龙这样的恐龙，体型有多大呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"티라노사우루스","meaning":"霸王龙","explanation":"티라노사우루스：霸王龙","readings":[{"term":"티라노사우루스","audio":"/audio/e19492308aacc6726692.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:티라노사우루스:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"티라노사우루스","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"티라노사우루스","audio":"/audio/e19492308aacc6726692.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"공룡은","meaning":"恐龙","explanation":"공룡：恐龙；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공룡","audio":"/audio/4b02690b9e11adc24fd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22844","senseId":"1","lemma":"공룡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공룡은","audio":"/audio/ab0e9fa173a551a3dd8a.mp3"}},{"text":"크기가","meaning":"大小，高矮，高低","explanation":"크기：大小，高矮，高低；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"크기","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62458","senseId":"1","lemma":"크기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크기가","audio":"/audio/7166ce66a48482967b55.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"커요?","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커요","audio":"/audio/f9f55e152f7b9cc0aeaa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e19492308aacc672","term":"티라노사우루스","zh":"霸王龙","audio":"/audio/e19492308aacc6726692.mp3","definition":"一种体型巨大的食肉恐龙。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"4b02690b9e11adc2","term":"공룡","zh":"恐龙","audio":"/audio/4b02690b9e11adc24fd0.mp3","entryId":"22844","definition":"很久以前生活在地球上现在已灭绝的，形体非常大的动物。","pronunciation":["공ː뇽"]},{"id":"82232621b82d72be","term":"크기","zh":"大小，高矮，高低","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3","entryId":"62458","definition":"物体的体积、宽度及量等的大小的程度。","pronunciation":["크기"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7bb58fddd910a27c28c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22844-1-7-2","ko":"코끼리보다도 더 크단다.","zh":"据说比大象还要大呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"코끼리보다도","meaning":"大象","explanation":"코끼리：大象；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"코끼리","audio":"/audio/6504c4e0dfbf5051694d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28148","senseId":"1","lemma":"코끼리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"코끼리보다도","audio":"/audio/317ad138c43635259ac8.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"크단다.","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔；表示引用。","explanation":"크